        "Content": "<ul><li>End of terrace house</li><li>Beautifully presented throughout</li><li>Period features</li><li>Private garage for up to two cars</li><li>Side access</li><li>Proximity to Ranelagh and Donnybrook villages</li><li>Promimity to good schools and transport links</ul>"
      },
